WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:05.940
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:12.400
Some flowers are born pure, while others bloom laced with poison.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:16.280
The Age of Detectives.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.580
The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.370
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.600
Now, it's only a bit further ahead!

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.940
Ahh, I'm pooped... C'mon guys, let's take the bus!

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:13.110
We don't have the money for that...

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:13.940
We don't...

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.390
Ahh, my bus!

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:25.160
Let's keep going! There's a clue about Toys on the cape ahead!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:28.530
That's right! Let's get back our Toys for sure this time!

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.600
Look, there it is!

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:41.230
We've reached it! It's over there!

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:55.190
So this is Phantom Thief Killer Cape...

00:02:56.050 --> 00:03:03.160
Yes, this is where the legendary multimillionaire Baskerville is said to have hidden the works of art he'd collected in his lifetime.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:09.200
There have been many phantom thieves who have tried to plunder it, but none have succeeded.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:12.630
Leave it to me, Arsène-sama!

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.960
Beautiful me shall marvelously steal it for you!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.920
By the way, I heard that Baskerville mysteriously died while researching Toys,

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:24.170
and that he'd gotten hold of some very important materials in his final years...

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.370
Well, this is easy compared to what we've been doing so far.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:30.090
There aren't any police or detectives around either!

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.840
It's the sea! The sea! Yay!

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:35.360
Yay!

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:36.800
Hiyah!

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:44.660
Wait for me!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.360
That's cold!

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:51.640
They're here...

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.590
What shall we do, Arsène-sama?

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.250
Huh? Henriette-san!

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:00.150
What are you doing here?

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.910
I could ask you the same question.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.970
We're taking the opportunity to bathe in the sea!

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:08.260
The opportunity? What else were you about to do?

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.830
Um...

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.910
Could it be that you have something to do at that cape?

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:16.840
That's right!

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:20.940
We've heard that there's this person named Bakers Gill that hid some stuff he'd collected up there!

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:23.280
It's Baskerville!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:27.570
Huh? Is G4 bathing in the sea too?

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.910
We haven't had a vacation for awhile!

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:32.760
Well then, let's swim together, Kokoro-chan!

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:35.420
Don't call me that!!

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:40.340
Besides, why'd you come to a little-known good beach that <i>I</i> found?!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:46.460
We've heard that there's an item up there that might help us get our Toys back.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.340
Where did you get that information?

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:49.760
From Nijuuri-sensei!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:56.350
How careless of beautiful <i>~moi!</i> Beauti-

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:59.210
Well then, let's start searching!

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.420
Yeah!

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:07.530
Is this kitten hungry, by any chance?

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:15.190
Actually, I'm sorta famished too...

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:19.530
We've walked all the way from the academy, so yeah...

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.830
In that case...

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.130
How about a spot of lunch?

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:27.240
Happily, the sea in this area is abundant with seafood,

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:30.140
so shall we alleviate our stomachs' fickleness a little?

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:35.830
Look, a fish! A fish!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.130
Let's see...

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.940
Whoa, found a crab!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.630
Awesome!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.030
No, my crab!!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.530
Hey, give it back!

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:51.620
Nero, aren't animals your specialty? Hurry and get it back!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.530
Um...

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:56.540
What if we all begged for it back...

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.620
Hey, give the crab back to us!

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.090
Please!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.150
We won't get mad, so come back!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:11.720
Hey, what was that for?! Give back the crab, dammit!

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.040
I pity them.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.200
Me too.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.550
Hey, can we swim now?

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:21.200
Well then, it's free time!

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.570
Give it back!

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.730
Crab! My crab!

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:31.670
It can't be helped.

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:34.430
Let's give up on the crab and look for something else.

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:35.940
Well then, let's split up...

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:39.140
Sounds good. Let's gather a lot of different ingredients.

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.350
Okay!

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.460
Nero, you can stop that now!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.250
My crab!!

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:50.040
I see. So this is her plan of distracting Milky Holmes by doing that,

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:53.860
and then obtaining the treasure of Baskerville while they're at it...

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:55.680
As expected of Arsène-sama.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:59.780
Even though this was an unexpected happening, we haven't lost our bearings!

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.420
And just who do you think caused this "happening"?

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:04.520
Ahh, I can't hear yo-

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.670
Yay!

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:08.510
Ahh, I've picked up a lot!

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:12.440
Let's see, is there anything else to eat...

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.940
Ahh, a watermelon!

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.470
Why is it here?

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:28.430
Just leave that thing alone. Let's have lunch!

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:32.760
Sorry 'bout that. No hard feelings, okay?

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:45.830
Even though I've seen her in her revealing Phantom Thief suit many times,

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.010
this is kind of...

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:51.130
The beach princess is Arsène-sama! And the prince is m-

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:55.370
Ahh, what a weird cloud...

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:56.350
Geez...

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.410
It's gonna storm, huh...

00:08:58.410 --> 00:08:59.430
It will.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:02.570
Ahh, I can feel a storm coming!

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:05.750
I wonder if there's somewhere around here we can take shelter...

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.190
Hey!

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.320
This way!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.440
There's a cave here!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:18.790
It's great that there's a cave here!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:22.080
But isn't this cave kinda weird?

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:23.840
Certainly...

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:27.090
Looks like it goes in pretty far...

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:31.730
I got it! A great treasure left by Bakers Gill is just ahead!

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:34.260
It's Baskerville!!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:38.300
Ooh, this really gives me the chills!

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.160
Maybe there really is something ahead?

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:43.120
Really? Just what kinda treasure is it?

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.800
Could there really be one here?

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:47.200
Looks like it. See?

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.350
Doesn't that make it even more suspicious?!

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:52.270
Well, just think of it as a test of courage...

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:55.320
B-But wait, it's so dark...

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.520
Cordelia-san, keep at it!

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:00.460
Listen, make sure you watch carefully where you step, okay?

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.700
It's dark! Dark! Dark!!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.220
Ahh, what'll we do?

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:18.880
They should be fine. Kokoro-san's there,
so she should be able to work something out.

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.010
Everyone, wake up!

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:26.810
Where are we?

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.320
The bottom of the pit, isn't it?

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:32.950
D-D-Dark...

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.560
S-S-Scary...

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.990
Cordelia-san, please stop that!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.890
You two are too much!

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:41.770
Hirano, shut her up.

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:45.680
I didn't hit a vital spot.

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:50.460
In his youth, Baskerville was an excellent detective.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:55.170
However, he lost his Toys at some point, and stopped being a detective.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:11:01.980
After he succeeded as a businessman, he continued to look for a way to get his Toys back.

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.350
Did he find it?

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:06.680
There's rumours of him having done so right before his death,

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.900
but none have been confirmed.

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:10.480
What if they were true?

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:13.520
What is this?

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:15.270
It seems to be an electronic lock.

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:19.260
Electronic means that if Nero uses her Toys...!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:22.280
Ehh? Well, if you say so...

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:31.950
No good, huh?

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:34.460
Hey! Don't say that!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.810
Ahh, I really thought it wouldn't work!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.810
Again!

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.610
How?!

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.310
Baskerville's pet dog's birthday.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:06.910
What is this?

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.250
As expected from the wealth of Bakers Gill-san!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.170
Mine!

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.600
So pretty!

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.500
Right, Henriette-san?

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.440
Huh? Eh?

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:43.130
"Phantom Thief Killer" certainly befits this place...

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.450
For now...

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:49.200
I have no choice but to move forward.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.770
Look, there's a tunnel here!

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:54.910
It could lead to the outside! Let's go in!

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:03.920
I am the great detective Cordelia! Upon my grandmother's name, whatever case it is...

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:07.220
I shall completely see through it!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:10.750
Hey, we're having an important discussion, so would you keep it quiet?

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:13.980
I'm sorry, I think she's having some weird delusion...

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:14.970
Hirano.

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:15.490
Yes!

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:28.420
Zenigata-san, are you all right?

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.990
S-Somehow...

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:34.620
Stop it! That's my last secret plac-

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.710
I'm sorry!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.170
It's getting brighter!

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:43.760
All right!

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:48.590
Huh? What? This is...

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.850
A-As if I'd lose to this!

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:57.370
Heavy...

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:08.310
I swear on the name of Akechi Kokoro,
the beautiful genius girl with an IQ of 13,000,

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:11.020
that we will get out of here!!

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.790
Being a beautiful girl has nothing to do with this...

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.830
I'm tired of this!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:22.210
Looking for hints is a detective's primer!

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.880
Wouldn't it be faster just to search all the rooms?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.520
There's a lot of traps, so it could be dangerous.

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:28.590
Pfft.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:30.850
Nero, here...

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.290
Um...

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:36.660
"I've finally obtained it."

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:39.890
"I've hoarded it in a secret room."

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:41.160
This could be...

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.570
The item that'll get us back our Toys!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.340
"My Treasured Article Room...?"

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:52.870
This is...

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:59.880
"The Spotted G-String"...

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:05.920
I've been locked in.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.800
Alright, I've decided!

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.620
Everyone, get naked!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.350
Why?

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:15.050
If we tie our swimsuits together, we can make a rope!

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.760
Tsugiko climbs up, and then pulls us up with her!

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:20.020
I do?

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:21.930
If you get it, then strip!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.730
Though you say that...

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.780
Director, I can't do that!

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:30.200
Even though I'm playing the lead role, getting naked...

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.900
Actually sounds good!

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.210
Shall I finish her off?

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:34.160
Forget it.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.350
I got it, director! I'll do it!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.990
If it's for the sake of the arts...!

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.450
I'll take it all off!

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:43.460
Cordelia-san! No!

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:47.790
Guess we'll have to strip...

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.380
You're right.

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.130
Herc, your skin is so pretty.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.640
C-Cordelia-san...

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:59.890
But somehow, I just wanna find that out for myself...

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:00.540
Huh?

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:04.840
Now then, let Onee-sama help-you-out!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.070
No!!

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:16.150
Ah, so you had a mole on this spot eh, Tsugiko-san?

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:18.970
Hey, if you do that,

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:19.760
then take this!

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:20.520
No!

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.710
Just strip normally, will ya?!

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:30.380
Whoa, it's like an art gallery!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:33.030
We'd make loads selling all these!

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:37.020
What we're searching for is a clue on our Toys! Not this place!

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:37.960
Aww...

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:46.730
This a radical 16-bit toy, the Pu-

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:52.710
Now I've done it. I might actually die now...

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.270
Is this heaven?

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:02.490
Oh, a heaven-friend.

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:03.330
I beg to differ.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.960
This is...

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.490
Um, our swimsuits...

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:17.920
I can't wear them anymore like this...

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:19.010
Mine too...

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:26.770
Why am I naked?! What have you done to me, Akechi-san?!

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.360
Why are you calling <i>me?!</i>

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:29.630
Shall I put her to sleep?

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.500
What's that?

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.190
A giant squid?!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:36.950
That's right...

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.660
Why is this here?

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:40.580
Is this related to Baskerville?

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.970
G-Giant squid...!

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:44.700
Squid noodles!

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.850
No, no!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.460
Roasted squid!

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.510
No mistake! This is it!

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:57.300
A secret to our Toys should be inside!

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.640
No good...

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.940
This must be another electronic lock...

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:10.130
Electronic! Nero!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:13.760
What the heck? Didn't my Toys not work earlier?

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:18.430
Don't say that! I'll pray along with you this time!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:21.810
If we join our hearts as one, we can surely do it!

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:24.450
Fine, then...

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:32.880
I beg you... Nero's Toys... come back...

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.640
Sher, what was that?!

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:42.680
I'm hungry cause I didn't have lunch...

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.760
Argh, it seemed like it was gonna work this time too!

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.650
It <i>accidentally</i> fell open!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.360
What could be inside?

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:56.730
What are these?

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:59.830
These are AKG48's limited edition figurines!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:02.870
Well then, could these be items that'll get us our Toys back?

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.000
More water?!

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.650
This coldness..

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:22.220
At the rate it's filling up, we'll drown to death within 51 seconds...

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:23.680
50...

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:24.800
49...

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:30.100
It's so cold!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.810
Sher, look here.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.690
Eh? What does it mean by five?

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.200
I dunno!

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:40.060
Only your Toys can break this device and stop the water, Nero!

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:42.070
Even if you say that...

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:45.680
Please! Try it one more time!

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:55.350
<i>Stop... stop... stop...</i>

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:59.290
<i>So cold!</i>

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:07.420
<i>Stop... stop... stop!</i>

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.850
<i>Do your best, Nero!</i>

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.310
<i>Please!</i>

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:31.580
It... It stopped!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.450
Banzai! Banzai!

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:48.870
It's warm!

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:52.420
So that number was actually the water's temperature!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:58.980
Herc-san!

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:00.990
So you were safe!

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.500
Ah, Kamaboko!

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.620
Huh? Where's Cordelia?

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:09.990
Oh, she's...

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.840
She's acting so wild...

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:17.840
That's kinda...

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:20.020
How about some squid?

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:25.000
<i>It's somehow become ridiculous to even think of stealing now.</i>

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:27.760
<i>Now that's "Phantom Thief Killer" for you.</i>

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.860
Ahh, I'm starved...

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:37.850
We haven't eaten in three days..

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:40.300
Give it!

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:41.430
Dammit!

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:41.810
Hey!

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:42.960
What are you doing?!

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.880
This is the fish that I caugh-

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:45.850
Hey!

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:21.190
That was the most entertaining day off we've had in awhile.

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:24.510
Sherlock, make sure you dry your hair properly, or you'll catch a cold.

00:23:24.510 --> 00:23:28.010
I had fun too! Henriette-san, you have a great body!

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:28.730
Is that right?

00:23:28.730 --> 00:23:32.560
That's right! It goes all boing-boing here and there!

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:33.650
What do you mean by that?

00:23:33.650 --> 00:23:35.280
Boing-boing, you know! Boing-boing!

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:37.390
By doing this, it goes even more boing-boing!

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:42.460
It doesn't looks like it's going boing-boing in the slightest, though.

00:23:42.460 --> 00:23:44.780
Next time: Boing-Boing Girl.

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:47.730
The culprit really is me!
